         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nEtruscan-Roman numbers use 7 symbols, but these symbols are not consecutive.\n\nIn this class, we keep studying Etruscan-Roman numbers and see how Mesoamerican numbers follow a similar logic.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
